&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Asset Movements Operations team at Robinhood is dedicated to offering fast, safe, and secure execution of customer requests such as wires, checks, and internal account transfers. As a critical pillar of Robinhood&#39;s brokerage business model, our team focuses on risk management and operational accuracy to support the firm&#39;s growth. We collaborate with Customer Experience, Clearing, Fraud, and Financial Crimes teams to troubleshoot complex issues and ensure seamless processing. Our culture thrives on teamwork, continuous improvement, and a shared dedication to protecting our customers&#39; assets. Together, we are building the future of retail brokerage operations!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Asset Movements Operations Specialist, you will play a central role in executing daily financial transactions with precision and resolving customer requests. In this position, you will be accountable for high-priority wire, check, and journal processing while identifying operational inefficiencies. You will collaborate with project and operations teams to launch and scale Robinhood&#39;s electronic financial products. Your analytical skills will be key in mitigating money movement risks and safeguarding customer and firm assets. This is an exciting opportunity to help build our brokerage infrastructure and grow your career with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Denver, CO or Westlake, TX office , with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week (Wednesday, Thursday and Friday).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process high-priority transactions, including wires, checks, journals, and bank-linking, ensuring accuracy and timely completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and manage money movement risks from both a customer and firm perspective to mitigate financial losses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with project and operations teams to test, launch, and scale retail brokerage products and operational systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and document operational processes and procedures to improve efficiency and maintain compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert in asset movements, collaborating with Customer Experience, Clearing, Fraud, and Financial Crimes teams to resolve complex customer issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in finance, accounting, business, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience), along with 4+ years of experience in brokerage operations or financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active FINRA Series 7 license; an active FINRA Series 24 license is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a demonstrated ability to identify process inefficiencies, propose concrete solutions, and manage operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to explain complex operational and compliance concepts clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail, deep knowledge of banking operation standards, and advanced familiarity with securities industry compliance policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
