&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood’s People team builds the systems and programs that empower employees to do the best work of their careers, with Total Rewards focused on attracting, retaining, and motivating talent at every stage of their journey. Our Benefits team is small but mighty: we own the health, welfare, retirement, and leave programs employees rely on, and we keep them competitive. We&#39;re building something special, and we take that responsibility seriously!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Benefits Partner to lead delivery of Robinhood&#39;s global health, welfare, retirement, and wellbeing programs. Reporting to the Head of Benefits, you&#39;ll shape strategy, drive renewals and vendor performance, lead leave of absence compliance in the US and abroad, and run benefits due diligence on acquisitions. You&#39;ll use data, automation, and AI to make sharper cost and plan design decisions and to scale as we enter new markets. This is a high-impact, highly visible role on a team where you&#39;ll build as much as you run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA, Chicago, IL and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global benefits programs, including US medical, dental, vision, life, disability, spending accounts, COBRA, 401(k), time off, and wellbeing, plus international benefits; setting direction and owning outcomes for cost, competitiveness, and employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead annual US and international renewals with consultants, brokers, and carrier by negotiating terms, holding vendors to performance guarantees, and driving pricing transparency (including PBM and TPA arrangements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze claims, utilization, cost trend, and vendor performance, building the financial models and benchmarking that support plan changes and budget forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead US and global leave of absence and benefits compliance, ensuring alignment with federal, state, and international regulations and supporting government filings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support M&amp;amp;A benefits due diligence and integration, assessing target plans and compliance exposure, briefing leadership on risks before close, and helping shape Day 1 versus runway harmonization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark and design competitive benefits as Robinhood enters new markets, partnering with brokers, local advisors, and in-country partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Internal Comms and PeopleX on benefits education, open enrollment messaging, and employee events, supporting US open enrollment and global renewals end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvements, new plan rollouts, and reporting in Workday, and support employee data auditing for partners in Payroll and Corporate Accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI and automation to claims analytics, plan and contract review, benchmarking, and M&amp;amp;A diligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of progressive benefits experience, including management of US health and welfare programs and leave of absence programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of hands-on Workday experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running renewals and managing brokers, carriers, and vendors, including contract negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and comfort building cost models and translating claims and financial data into clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International benefits experience across multiple countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment, a sharp eye for detail, and the ability to explain complex topics simply to employees and executives while maintaining confidentiality and professionalism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building with AI, not just using it: you can point to analyses, dashboards, or workflows you&#39;ve built with AI tools and the impact they had&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: M&amp;amp;A due diligence or integration experience; PBM or TPA transparency work; fintech or high-growth company experience; CEBS or similar certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
