&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Limit:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates may submit no more than 3 applications in any 90 days. Within that time, they may apply to each role only once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":84604,"name":"Brokerage Operations - RHS","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":79699,"name":"Chicago, IL","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null},{"id":66322,"name":"Denver, CO","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null},{"id":26919,"name":"Lake Mary, FL","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null},{"id":76689,"name":"New York, NY","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8303977/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://boards.greenhouse.io/robinhood/jobs/8357464?t=gh_src=&gh_jid=8357464","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"education":"education_required","internal_job_id":3612043,"location":{"name":"New York, NY"},"metadata":[{"id":4288026,"name":"Careers Page Bucket","value":"EARLY TALENT AND INTERNSHIPS","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8357464,"updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:14:12-05:00","requisition_id":"1963","title":"Corporate Finance Intern (Summer 2027)","company_name":"Robinhood","first_published":"2026-11-13T16:14:12-05:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate Finance team’s mission is to generate accurate and actionable insights for leadership regarding business performance, and communicate them in a way that empowers strategic decision making. We own the company’s consolidated financial picture, including forecasting, planning, and reporting. We translate operating activity into the financial narrative that leadership, the Board, and investors rely on. As the business scales, the team keeps sharpening how we understand and explain performance across Robinhood’s product suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Corporate Finance Intern, you will join the team during forecast cycles and work with stakeholders across Brokerage, Crypto, and Money. You will help turn granular data into the clear takeaways senior leadership needs to make strategic decisions. You will also contribute to the team’s consolidated model and the reporting used across the Finance org to track key performance indicators. Along the way, you will partner with Investor Relations to support the CFO and senior leadership ahead of quarterly earnings, and experience a full earnings cycle from the inside.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our New York office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with stakeholders across Brokerage, Crypto, and Money during forecast cycles, consolidating granular data into the clear takeaways senior leadership needs to inform strategic decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and upgrade the team’s consolidated model so the team can keep generating sharper insight into business performance as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting surfaces used across the Finance org to track key performance indicators spanning Robinhood’s product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Investor Relations to prepare the CFO and senior leadership for quarterly earnings, building the analytical support behind the company’s quarterly performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how the business operates — how it earns, where it spends, and how it allocates capital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in how macroeconomic conditions shape customer behavior, and how that behavior reaches financial results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong work ethic and a drive to improve processes rather than just run them, including using AI tools to streamline workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear writing, and the ability to compress a complicated analysis into a few sentences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive compensation structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly lifestyle wallet for personal wellness, learning and development, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time away including company holidays, paid time off, and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lively office environment with catered meals, fully stocked kitchens, and geo-specific commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
