&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end Contact Center program management for complex, cross-functional initiatives — scope, milestones, success metrics, governance structures from kickoff through the program lifetime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Legal, Compliance, and Risk to ensure CX initiatives meet regulatory requirements (FINRA, SEC, state securities regulations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run governance cadences — steering committees, status reporting, executive updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own risk identification and mitigation, maintaining RAID logs and escalating regulatory/operational/tech risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external vendor and financial-services partner relationships — contract deliverables, SLAs, escalation paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own change management for production changes — testing, sign-off, rollback plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audits, regulatory exams, and inquiries — documentation, stakeholder responses, evidence gathering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain KPI/metrics reporting for program health, adoption, business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as BNY Contact Center Engagement Owner during Trump Account incidents — single point of contact for RH&#39;s CX team, alongside the incident ATC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead incident management and business continuity for production issues affecting customer-facing brokerage systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the program&#39;s U.S. Treasury waiver and compliance commitments — deadline tracking, renewal reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-stakeholder programs with external financial-services partners, vendors, or regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial agency relationships, trustee/custodial structures, or public-sector fintech — or comparable experience in a heavily contracted, multi-party environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident management and crisis communication experience — formal severity/on-call processes, cross-company coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in ambiguity — building governance/SOPs for a first-of-its-kind program vs. an established playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written/verbal communication, executive-level reporting for internal and external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance-adjacent experience — regulated-data handling, contractual waiver management, third-party vendor governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional leadership across Legal, Compliance, Security, Engineering, CX, and BPO oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience; PMP or similar a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is restricted to US citizens or lawful permanent residents due to legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
