&lt;p&gt;Robinhood’s Customer Experience team plays a critical role in Democratizing Finance for All. Our customer experience team supports customers across a wide range of account needs, delivering timely, accurate, and empathetic support across multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Experience Team Lead within the Executive Office, you will serve as a technical leader and subject matter expert, helping our team deliver accurate, timely, and thoughtful resolutions to complex customer concerns. You will provide hands-on coaching, strengthen investigative and problem-solving capabilities, and support consistent execution of our quality and regulatory standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with the Customer Experience Manager to drive operational excellence, manage case priorities, and identify opportunities to improve processes and customer outcomes. This role requires strong judgment, attention to detail, and the ability to navigate sensitive situations while fostering a culture of accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
