&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical subject matter expert, providing guidance and coaching on complex customer complaints, investigations, and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop team capabilities through hands-on coaching, case reviews, knowledge sharing, and actionable feedback that strengthens quality, judgment, and resolution effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support daily operations by monitoring case queues, prioritizing time-sensitive matters, and ensuring cases are assigned, progressed, and resolved within established service-level and regulatory timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on sensitive or high-risk customer situations, partnering with Compliance, Legal, and other internal teams to support appropriate resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor case quality, productivity, and operational trends, identifying opportunities to improve team performance, processes, and the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Customer Experience Manager to reinforce operational standards, drive accountability, and support continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example by directly managing complex customer cases and supporting the team during periods of increased volume or operational need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active FINRA Series 7, Series 63, Series 9/10 OR Series 24 &lt;/strong&gt;preferred. Ability to obtain Series 3 within 120 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling complex customer concerns, escalations, or complaints within a financial services or regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical coaching and leadership skills, with the ability to develop others through feedback, guidance, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to communicate clearly and professionally in sensitive or high-stakes situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong investigative, analytical, and problem-solving skills with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and the ability to balance customer outcomes, regulatory requirements, and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage competing priorities, meet critical deadlines, and maintain accuracy in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively across teams and influence outcomes without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility in scheduling to support business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
