&lt;p&gt;Great companies are built by great leaders, and you&#39;ll be the one finding them. As an Executive Sourcer at Robinhood, you&#39;ll uncover and win over the leaders who will shape our next chapter, across every function of the business. You&#39;ll partner with our executive recruiters and business leaders to set the bar for each search, map the market, surface insights that guide decisions, and design sourcing strategies that reach hard-to-find candidates. Your pipelines will power our biggest hires and support long-term succession planning. These are high-stakes, high-visibility searches, and you&#39;ll help evolve how sourcing and research work at Robinhood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Chicago, IL, Menlo Park, CA, and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain executive-level candidate pipelines through market mapping, research, and targeted outreach across all functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage passive executive talent using sourcing strategies, competitive intelligence, and relationship-building approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive recruiters and hiring leaders to align on leadership profiles, succession priorities, and long-term pipeline planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools such as Greenhouse, Gem, AI-supported sourcing tools, and executive research platforms to track candidates, organize workflows, and improve outreach effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze sourcing data, outreach effectiveness, and talent market trends to refine engagement strategies and improve pipeline quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in executive search, advising clients on talent and hiring, and managing the search process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying and engaging passive candidates from top industry players through research, outreach, and sourcing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner with recruiters and senior stakeholders to translate business priorities into targeted sourcing and research strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using sourcing tools (such as Gem, LinkedIn Recruiter, or similar platforms) and applicant tracking systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple executive searches and maintain accurate pipeline tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools to support sourcing, research, and outreach, with an interest in testing new tools to improve efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
