&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qt1ghs&quot; data-start=&quot;2977&quot; data-end=&quot;3092&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of professional iOS engineering experience building and shipping production mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2jwiiz&quot; data-start=&quot;3093&quot; data-end=&quot;3217&quot;&gt;You have proficiency in Swift and experience developing applications using modern iOS frameworks and architecture patterns&lt;/li&gt;
