&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all internal workstreams across Marketing, Creative, Legal and Compliance teams to ensure cohesion for Brokerage related work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate meetings to ensure information exchange and understanding across teams - creating and owning agendas, action items, and follow ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports Marketers to ensure all aspects of the program are on track, and flag delays or facilitate trade off discussions when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
