&lt;li&gt;Own the submission process for Legal &amp;amp; Compliance review, spearheading weekly check-ins, and ensuring materials are revised where necessary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead QA Process of all assets, ensuring quality standards are met and work is complete.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports reporting cadence and facilitates retros, consolidating feedback and implementing optimizations for future work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborates with product-specific MPMs to ensure proper product representation when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
