&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Limit:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates may submit no more than 3 applications in any 90 days. Within that time, they may apply to each role only once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":91657,"name":"PeopleX Division","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":79699,"name":"Chicago, IL","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null},{"id":17714,"name":"Menlo Park, CA","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null},{"id":76689,"name":"New York, NY","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8350199/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://boards.greenhouse.io/robinhood/jobs/8313806?t=gh_src=&gh_jid=8313806","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3594563,"location":{"name":"Chicago, IL; Denver, CO; Westlake, TX"},"metadata":[{"id":4288026,"name":"Careers Page Bucket","value":"OPERATIONS","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8313806,"updated_at":"2026-11-17T13:29:44-05:00","requisition_id":"JR109789","title":"Platforms Risk and Control Specialist","company_name":"Robinhood","first_published":"2026-11-17T13:29:44-05:00","language":"en","application_deadline":"2027-01-21T13:29:44-05:00","content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We&#39;re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood&#39;s Platforms Governance team works to keep our platforms secure and trustworthy. We partner with business teams to design the structures, policies, and processes that put safety first, guide decisions, manage risk, and support compliance. Our work also covers fraud prevention, detection, investigation, and recovery. Together, these efforts protect the firm and our customers from the impact of fraud and protect the integrity of our operations. We take pride in the trust our customers place in us, and we work every day to earn it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your role as a Platform Risk &amp;amp; Control Specialist, you will partner with Governance pillar leaders to define, scope, and project manage critical cross-Governance initiatives, support international expansion across key functions, and facilitate departmental planning and organizational strategy to drive scalability and operational maturity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Chicago, IL, Denver, CO and Westlake, TX offices, with in-person attendance expected 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Governance pillar leaders to define, scope, and project manage the most important cross-Governance strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee international expansion for Governance workstreams, ensuring proper coverage for all key functions across geographies and entities (including SVI, Complaints, Control Testing, Entity Syncs, and Policy support).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver support for various Golden Eagle workstreams (brokerage, call center, fraud) across areas supported by Governance (Risk, QA, Controls, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reports &amp;amp; trend analysis that monitor compliance and risk exposures at the agent, team &amp;amp; business level. Communicate trends to key stakeholders on a regular basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherance to predetermined risk standards, complete required deliverables and comply with business standard operating procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with designated principals and team managers to share control issues and provide regular reports on overall performance and trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree from an accredited institution and/or 3+ years experience in Operations in a customer obsessive organization, either at a start up, fintech or financial services company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in risk programs and/or customer-facing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uncompromising integrity and strong dedication to professionalism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think critically and apply logical problem-solving skills to resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to concisely and accurately communicate complex topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GRC tooling (e.g. Diligent, Auditboard)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FINRA Licenses 7, 63 and 24 strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
