&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in designing distributed systems, APIs, and data models for reliability and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading medium-to-large technical projects with multiple stakeholders and clear business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in ambiguous, fast-moving product environments and turn open-ended problems into pragmatic execution plans&lt;/li&gt;
