&lt;li&gt;Support investor relations and the quarterly earnings process and help ensure Regulation FD compliance for all investor communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all treasury and tax-related matters, including capital markets transactions, credit facilities, stock repurchase plans, tax structuring, and intercompany arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively and responsively with a broad range of stakeholders, and develop trusted relationships to facilitate a coordinated team approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
