&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing external relationships with technology vendors and/or advisor or client firms in a regulated financial services environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort serving as a primary external face for the organization, including event hosting, executive-level relationship management, and negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, with experience working closely with Product, Engineering, Legal and Compliance, Marketing, and technical integrations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the RIA custodial technology landscape (portfolio management systems, CRM, TAMP, and financial planning tools) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
