&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for Trading Tools and Say&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a cross-functional team of engineers, designers, and data scientists to ship on mobile at high quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how active traders research and act on positions through charts, watchlists, research, and the trading ladder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Say by making shareholder Q&amp;amp;A and proxy voting easy and relevant for everyday investors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, experimentation, and user research to decide what to build and measure the results&lt;/li&gt;
