&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, and roll out features in React and TypeScript across trading flows, options onboarding, and monitoring tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end to end, from options team projects to large efforts that involve cross-team collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
