&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers and designers (and content designers when needed) to shape and ship customer-facing features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the mobile options team so options features feel consistent across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional software development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong web engineering fundamentals, with hands-on experience building production web applications in React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills, with a record of finding root causes in performance and data problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning projects end to end, from design through development, testing, and rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading projects and setting technical direction, such as improving performance or observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication about technical tradeoffs with engineers, product managers, and designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: familiarity with options trading or other fintech and trading products (no options experience is required, and we&#39;ll teach you the domain)&lt;/li&gt;
