&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2939&quot;&gt;You have domain knowledge and expertise in traditional credit data. Experience with non traditional credit data (such as cash flow) is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
