&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood set out to open the financial system to the many, not the few. We&#39;ve done it for tens of millions of people in the US—now we&#39;re expanding into Canada. This is one of the most ambitious expansion initiatives for the company, and you&#39;d be sitting at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager on the Canada Expansion team, you&#39;ll manage localized product offerings, own end-to-end product experiences tailored for Canadian users, and work with experts in data, design, engineering, marketing, operations, and regulatory affairs to bring ideas to life that will help us democratize finance in Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Toronto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The International PM team&#39;s goal is simple to say and hard to do: democratize finance globally. That means scaling our products to work across many regions &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; building market-specific experiences that serve customers where they are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff PM on this team, you&#39;ll own product strategy and execution in Canada and set the playbook for user acquisition, growth, and localized offerings across the country. Additionally, you will: -&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship tailored financial products into the Canadian market working shoulder-to-shoulder with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together product development teams to craft and communicate a Canada-focused product vision and set of priorities that address the specific financial needs of Canadian consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the roadmap—adapting existing trading features and building local tax-advantaged features and funding rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong, collaborative relationships across design, engineering, and operations at the team and organizational levels.&lt;/li&gt;
