&lt;p&gt;Bitstamp made history in 2011 as the world’s first regulated crypto exchange. As a key part of the Robinhood family, the &lt;strong&gt;Exchange Platform team&lt;/strong&gt; owns the full service lifecycle. We are the architects of a modern, high-velocity ecosystem that enables our global expansion, ensuring the world’s longest-running exchange remains unshakeable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Backend Engineer on the Exchange Platform team, you will define the technical vision, long-term architectural roadmap, and engineering standards for our platform modernization strategy. You will serve as a primary technical leader across the Bitstamp exchange ecosystem—architecting the next generation of cloud infrastructure for mission-critical, low-latency services, driving complex distributed systems integrations, and elevating the technical bar across Robinhood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our London office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requires participation in an on-call rotation to support business needs.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Strategic Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and drive the long-term architectural vision for high-availability, low-latency cloud platforms, setting engineering standards that ensure performance, reliability, and portability across our global ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Modernization at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Spearhead multi-quarter modernization initiatives, driving the transition of foundational services to resilient, containerized cloud environments while optimizing deployment pipelines and auto-scaling patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct High-Stakes Integrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the technical alignment and distributed architecture bridging Bitstamp’s exchange backend with Robinhood’s global infrastructure, solving complex cross-organization technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eliminate Operational Toil &amp;amp; Technical Debt:&lt;/strong&gt; Anticipate future scalability bottlenecks and architect self-healing systems and intelligent automation that radically reduce operational load and boost developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Systemic Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Take end-to-end accountability for ambiguous, high-impact technical initiatives—navigating complex trade-offs between speed, resilience, cost, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor and elevate senior engineers, lead architectural design reviews, and establish engineering best practices that raise the bar across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uphold Platform Resilience: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for high-severity incidents, lead rigorous post-mortems, and institute systemic safeguards to ensure 24/7 unshakeable platform integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: 8+ years of relevant experience in backend and distributed systems engineering, with a proven track record of operating as a technical lead or Staff-level engineer in high-scale environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Cloud &amp;amp; Container Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced architectural expertise with containerization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes) and enterprise-scale AWS cloud services (EC2, ECS/EKS, Aurora, DynamoDB).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Systems &amp;amp; Low-Latency Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of high-concurrency, low-latency backend architectures, event-driven systems, fault tolerance, and data consistency models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Autonomy &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to take ambiguous, organization-wide problems from inception to production, successfully delivering high-impact business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with the ability to build technical consensus, influence cross-functional roadmaps, and align senior engineering and product stakeholders across multiple geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;A pragmatic, systems-thinking mindset that balances forward-looking architectural evolution with the operational realities of supporting a 24/7 financial exchange.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3309&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3327&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3378&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3486&quot;&gt;Top tier benefits to fuel your work, including supplemental health insurance, ancillary insurance, and mental health support programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3621&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3735&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible employer-paid benefits spending account expenses beyond traditional benefits such as wellness, childcare, learning, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3899&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, paid volunteer time off, parental leave, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4026&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4114&quot;&gt;Monthly commuter stipend to help offset in-office commuting costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
