&lt;p&gt;The Product Creative team is a small but mighty group embedded within Robinhood’s broader product design organization. We work cross-functionally with designers, product managers, engineers, and other creative teams to build and ship world-class product experiences, and uphold and evolve Robinhood’s distinctive identity. Our team believes in raising the bar on visual craft while maintaining system scalability and cohesion across every touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Visual Designer on the Product Creative team, you’ll help define and shape Robinhood’s product design language. This role is ideal for a highly experienced individual contributor who thrives on ownership, brings deep expertise in visual design systems, and collaborates with teams across the company to ship iconic, user-centric work. You’ll work on high-impact product launches and the visual systems that power Robinhood’s growing suite of products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Bellevue, WA, Menlo Park, CA, and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
