&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional partners including designers, engineers, and product managers to shape visual direction and ensure consistency across the Robinhood product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve aspects of Robinhood’s design language – including icons, color schemes, and UI components across the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Robinhood’s high-impactest product launches with strong attention to visual craft and storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve our internal design system to be AI-ready and support new aesthetics and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for design excellence and provide mentorship through critique and shared best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in visual design and exceptional attention to detail across typography, layout, color, and composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and evolving scalable design systems in a product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to influence and advocate for design decisions across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of design tools such as Figma, plus experience with generative AI design tools (e.g., MidJourney, Lovable, Magic Patterns, etc) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex stakeholder environments and balancing design rigor with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
